graph TB
    subgraph CLI["rhai-cli (odh-cli)"]
        direction TB
        Main[Main CLI<br/>cobra framework]

        subgraph LintEngine["Lint Engine (pkg/lint/)"]
            LintRegistry[Check Registry<br/>48 checks, 5 groups]
            LintBuilders[Fluent Builders<br/>Component, Operator,<br/>Workload, DSC, DSCI]
            LintRegistry --> LintBuilders
        end

        subgraph MigrateFramework["Migration Framework (pkg/migrate/)"]
            ActionRegistry[Action Registry<br/>~30 migration tasks]
            PreUpgrade[Pre-Upgrade Actions]
            PostUpgrade[Post-Upgrade Actions]
            ActionRegistry --> PreUpgrade
            ActionRegistry --> PostUpgrade
        end

        subgraph MCPServer["MCP Server (pkg/mcp/)"]
            MCPAdapter[Tool Adapter<br/>13 CLI tools exposed]
            StdioTransport[stdio Transport]
            SSETransport[SSE Transport<br/>127.0.0.1:8080]
            MCPAdapter --> StdioTransport
            MCPAdapter --> SSETransport
        end

        subgraph BackupPipeline["Backup Pipeline (pkg/backup/)"]
            Discovery[Discovery Stage]
            Resolution[Resolution Stage]
            Writer[Writing Stage<br/>YAML output]
            Discovery --> Resolution --> Writer
        end

        Main --> LintEngine
        Main --> MigrateFramework
        Main --> MCPServer
        Main --> BackupPipeline
    end

    User[Platform Engineer<br/>/ Admin] -->|CLI commands| Main

    AIAgent[AI Agent<br/>e.g. Claude] -->|stdio / SSE| MCPServer

    subgraph K8sCluster["Kubernetes / OpenShift Cluster"]
        K8sAPI[Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS]
        DSC[DataScienceCluster CR]
        DSCI[DSCInitialization CR]
        OLM[OLM<br/>Subscriptions, CSVs]
    end

    LintEngine -->|read CRDs| K8sAPI
    MigrateFramework -->|read/write CRDs| K8sAPI
    BackupPipeline -->|discover & export| K8sAPI

    TrustyAI[TrustyAI REST API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS]
    MigrateFramework -->|backup/restore metrics| TrustyAI

    GitHub[odh-gitops<br/>GitHub raw content<br/>443/TCP HTTPS]
    Main -->|fetch dependency manifest| GitHub

    style CLI fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style LintEngine fill:#5b9bd5,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style MigrateFramework fill:#5b9bd5,stroke:#333,color:#fff
